1
00:00:03,300 --> 00:00:07,842
On the While callers wait card, the Welcome message is spoken once when

2
00:00:07,842 --> 00:00:09,847
the caller enters the queue.

3
00:00:09,847 --> 00:00:12,207
Hold music comes from Voice media.

4
00:00:12,207 --> 00:00:14,920
Empty uses the phone provider's default.

5
00:00:16,524 --> 00:00:20,585
The Announcement interval interrupts the music with an update.

6
00:00:20,585 --> 00:00:26,138
Announce the caller's place in line, and Announce the estimated wait, set what it says.

7
00:00:26,138 --> 00:00:29,004
The estimate uses the Average handle time.

8
00:00:29,506 --> 00:00:33,794
On the Callback card, the Callback key is the key a waiting caller

9
00:00:33,794 --> 00:00:38,200
presses to hang up and be called back, and keep their place in line.

10
00:00:38,200 --> 00:00:41,594
Offer callback after sets how long they wait first.

11
00:00:41,594 --> 00:00:42,606
Click Save.

